OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's #15m savings could be
OL,4,Afelt 'beyond the campus', union warns  
OL,6,FA university's plans to make savings of
OL,7,F"at least" #15m could lead to "large   
OL,8,Fscale job losses" and have a wider     
OL,9,Fimpact on the city and local community,
OL,10,Fa union has warned.                    
OL,12,FBangor University said the savings     
OL,13,Fwould be made through voluntary        
OL,14,Fredundancies and a "long-term review"  
OL,15,Fof structures, partnerships and        
OL,16,Foperations as it faces an              
OL,17,F"unprecedented financial threat".      
OL,19,FIt follows efforts to address          
OL,20,Fsignificant financial challenges facing
OL,21,Fthe sector across Wales and the UK.    
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
